{"id":4044,"date":"2025-03-13T12:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-03-13T11:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=4044"},"modified":"2025-02-25T15:44:56","modified_gmt":"2025-02-25T14:44:56","slug":"why-a-mobile-friendly-website-is-crucial-for-you-as-an-entrepreneur","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/why-a-mobile-friendly-website-is-crucial-for-you-as-an-entrepreneur\/","title":{"rendered":"Why a mobile-friendly website is crucial for you as an entrepreneur."},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a world where most people use their smartphone to surf the internet, a mobile-friendly website is no longer an option, but a must! Whether it&#8217;s for online shopping, social media or looking up information, most people use their mobile phone. With a responsive design, you can ensure that your website performs optimally on any device, from smartphone to desktop. This not only improves your user experience, but also increases your conversions and search engine findability. In this blog, we would like to tell you more about why a mobile-friendly website is crucial for your business.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What does a mobile-friendly website entail?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A mobile-friendly website automatically adjusts to the screen size of the device being used. This principle is also known as a <em>responsive design.<\/em> A responsive design ensures that text, images, and buttons always remain clear and easily accessible, whether the visitor is using a smartphone, tablet or desktop computer. This means that users do not have to zoom in or scroll horizontally to view the content, which considerably improves the user experience.<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/lauren-mancke-qc3sE5lGLbA-unsplash-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4051 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/lauren-mancke-qc3sE5lGLbA-unsplash-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/lauren-mancke-qc3sE5lGLbA-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why is a mobile-friendly website so important?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Google prioritizes mobile-friendly websites<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A mobile-friendly website has a direct impact on your online visibility. For years, Google has used a <em>\u2018mobile-first\u2019 indexing<\/em>, which means that the mobile version of your website determines your ranking in the search results. This means that investing in a mobile-friendly design not only improves your user experience, but also directly contributes to your online findability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>The majority of internet traffic comes from mobile devices.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Visitors expect a smooth and user-friendly experience, regardless of the device they are using. Does your website not work properly on a smartphone or tablet? Then there is a good chance they will leave and go to a competitor that does offer an optimal mobile experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Did you know that more than 50% of all internet traffic worldwide is via mobile devices?<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>A better user experience leads to higher conversions<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A mobile-friendly website ensures that visitors can navigate easily, find the right information quickly, and move smoothly through the purchasing process. This increases the chance that visitors will take action sooner. A poor mobile experience leads to frustration, causing visitors to drop out more quickly and your conversion rate to drop.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Faster loading times with a mobile-friendly website<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mobile users do not want long loading times; speed is crucial for a good user experience. A website that loads too slowly causes visitors to leave before the page is fully visible. Mobile optimization ensures that your website loads faster on smartphones, so that visitors will stay on your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-100\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426707033617-How-to-optimize-your-website-for-mobile\">Check out our article for more useful tips!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">So, are you ready to make your website mobile-friendly?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is therefore necessary to make your website mobile-friendly in 2025. It ensures a better user experience, higher conversions and a better position in Google. With the growth of mobile internet users and the demands of search engines, there is no reason to be left behind!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Make sure your website is ready for the future and offer your visitors the experience they expect.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\">Start now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In a world where most people use their smartphone to surf the internet, a mobile-friendly website is no longer an option, but a must! Whether it&#8217;s for online shopping, social media or looking up information, most people use their mobile phone. With a responsive design, you can ensure that your website performs optimally on any&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4098,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[31,29],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-